WEBVTT

00:19.820 --> 00:24.258
Tozasareta kioku no
naka no kizu ga

00:24.258 --> 00:28.796
Oto mo naku kokoro
ni fureru toki ni

00:28.796 --> 00:36.100
Yasashiku hohoemu sono ura
ni wa kodoku no namida

00:36.637 --> 00:41.342
Hateshinai tsuyosa motomete

00:41.342 --> 00:51.911
Shinjiru monotachi to
nando mo kakeagare

00:52.219 --> 00:54.254
Mamoritai

00:54.254 --> 00:56.423
Shinjitai

00:56.423 --> 01:00.861
Egao no wake wo subete

01:00.861 --> 01:05.132
Hageshisa mo itoshisa mo

01:05.132 --> 01:09.403
Zenbu uketomeru yo

01:09.403 --> 01:13.107
Nidoto sono te wo hanasanai

01:13.107 --> 01:22.038
Ano hikari wo mezashite...

01:31.091 --> 01:34.492
Previously on Shonen Onmyouji...

01:35.229 --> 01:39.495
The ability to destroy
a deity now resides in you.

01:41.101 --> 01:44.738
But first, you'll need
an object to contain it.

01:44.738 --> 01:48.342
All you have to do
is borrow Suzaku's sword.

01:48.342 --> 01:52.472
There's still something
I need to ask of you.

01:53.914 --> 01:58.874
I also have a favor to ask.

02:01.622 --> 02:03.613
Breathe!

02:08.629 --> 02:11.928
Sharpen and Polish
the Blade of Fire

02:19.173 --> 02:23.243
And now you will perish in
the fires of the netherworld.

02:23.243 --> 02:26.007
I will not surrender to you!

02:26.480 --> 02:28.471
Strong, shatter, break!

02:30.951 --> 02:33.954
- What's this?
- Touda!

02:33.954 --> 02:37.014
- I'm going to bury you!
- Dirty tricks...

02:40.160 --> 02:43.220
- Touda!
- You're hardly a match for me!

02:51.305 --> 02:53.707
You're the guardian spirit
of the returning path?

02:53.707 --> 02:55.698
I am.

03:04.818 --> 03:08.722
Kouchin!
Are you trying to stop me?

03:08.722 --> 03:12.021
- Stand down, Seiryuu!
- I've sworn to destroy Touda!

03:14.161 --> 03:18.097
- He's made the same mistake!
- Back off, Seiryuu!

03:21.468 --> 03:25.172
I will... destroy him!

03:25.172 --> 03:27.299
It's that kid from before.

03:36.683 --> 03:38.674
The loser that failed to die.

03:42.289 --> 03:45.019
This time,
I'll make sure you stay dead!

03:48.729 --> 03:52.199
- What's that?
- That sword can kill a deity...

03:52.199 --> 03:57.364
Someone who's so determined is far
stronger than we imagine.

03:58.038 --> 04:01.166
Makareya! Makareyo!
Arrows of light!

04:06.046 --> 04:08.105
Seal! Ban!

04:18.992 --> 04:20.983
Bind!

04:26.767 --> 04:29.603
- He's captured Touda!
- Watch carefully...

04:29.603 --> 04:35.909
Witness Masahiro's resolution.
It's a direct order from Seimei.

04:35.909 --> 04:37.900
How dare you!

04:39.112 --> 04:42.082
I summon the great deity
Kokyusanki!

04:42.082 --> 04:45.984
I ask for your sacred presence!
Capture all evil spirits now!

04:49.690 --> 04:53.217
- Darn you!
- Shatter!

04:56.230 --> 04:59.393
I'll destroy you with my fire!

05:01.268 --> 05:03.637
I repel all evil and
deflect all curses...

05:03.637 --> 05:05.628
with this incantation!

05:07.975 --> 05:10.967
Y-You...

05:20.120 --> 05:22.486
Stay away!

05:24.291 --> 05:27.124
Don't come near me!

05:29.896 --> 05:32.831
Stop it!

05:39.206 --> 05:45.078
You... How dare you...

05:45.078 --> 05:51.518
Tenjin, Chigi... Deities of the sky
and earth and great deity Ubusuna.

05:51.518 --> 05:55.648
Gather your mighty armies
and enforce this binding spell!

05:57.124 --> 06:00.327
Inflict great pain, go swiftly
along the oracle's path.

06:00.327 --> 06:02.318
Block every escape.

06:02.462 --> 06:06.533
Bring everything to a standstill
and bind this spirit!

06:06.533 --> 06:09.366
Ten thousand demons,
surrender!

06:21.415 --> 06:24.685
You're going to be an onmyouji.
The ultimate one.

06:24.685 --> 06:26.880
The one that will
surpass Seimei.

06:35.696 --> 06:39.066
- It's going to be okay!
- Tsuyuki!

06:39.066 --> 06:41.296
That child will return
home safely.

06:42.269 --> 06:47.206
I'm his mother. Even if you don't say
anything; I know what's going on.

06:47.908 --> 06:50.069
I'm sorry to make you worried.

07:10.764 --> 07:12.959
And what are you looking at?

07:18.972 --> 07:21.702
See, it's not as scary
as you think.

07:30.450 --> 07:32.753
But if that's what you desire,

07:32.753 --> 07:35.188
I'll do my best to make
that happen.

07:35.188 --> 07:37.457
I'll lend you my strength.

07:37.457 --> 07:41.461
After all, that's why
I'm by your side.

07:41.461 --> 07:46.831
Mokkun... Mokkun... Mokkun!

07:51.304 --> 07:56.298
The seal is protected
by a young human child.

08:01.181 --> 08:06.949
- A young human child...
- Seimei said he's his only heir.

08:13.560 --> 08:20.523
Hey Mokkun, it's okay
to let go of painful memories.

08:23.270 --> 08:28.333
Rest now,
all troubles and sorrows...

08:30.977 --> 08:33.445
I humbly call you back.

08:38.118 --> 08:40.687
These nightmares...

08:40.687 --> 08:43.723
no matter how many
times you've seen them,

08:43.723 --> 08:45.714
just hang on.

08:50.063 --> 08:53.055
Come back to me, Mokkun.

08:56.136 --> 08:59.537
I exchange my life for yours.

09:08.782 --> 09:10.773
Masahiro?

09:13.587 --> 09:15.578
Masahiro!

09:38.545 --> 09:41.081
- What's this?
- What's happened here?

09:41.081 --> 09:45.051
- Masahiro killed Touda.
- Then why's Masahiro like this?

09:45.051 --> 09:48.452
- Kouchin, what happened?
- Seimei...

09:51.658 --> 09:53.785
Masahiro...

10:01.535 --> 10:07.240
Takaokami no Kami, what news
does the western wind bring?

10:07.240 --> 10:11.378
Tenkuu of the 12 shikigami...

10:11.378 --> 10:14.711
it appears that the seal
to the underworld is safe.

10:15.916 --> 10:19.152
But I wasn't expecting you.

10:19.152 --> 10:24.157
Seimei's successor intended
to sacrifice himself.

10:24.157 --> 10:27.928
I wanted to find out if he's
acted up to his determination.

10:27.928 --> 10:29.896
He's very interesting.

10:29.896 --> 10:36.102
He begged me to allow Touda
to be revived unchanged.

10:36.102 --> 10:41.775
Did you let him
exchange his life for Touda's?

10:41.775 --> 10:47.414
It comes with a price when
you change the rules.

10:47.414 --> 10:51.077
And he accepted it
without hesitation.

10:54.387 --> 11:00.019
Sometimes, humans' determination
amazes even deities.

11:08.802 --> 11:11.635
This must be
difficult for Seimei.

11:12.539 --> 11:15.875
Yes, not only has
he lost his grandson...

11:15.875 --> 11:20.938
He must erase all memory
of Masahiro from everyone.

11:21.047 --> 11:28.221
I heard Masahiro didn't want
anyone to mourn his passing.

11:28.221 --> 11:32.826
This must be heartbreaking
for Masahiro and Seimei.

11:32.826 --> 11:37.263
Fate has not been kind to Seimei
when it comes to his loved ones.

11:37.263 --> 11:43.259
Both Masahiro and Wakana...
they left him so early in life.

11:48.208 --> 11:51.011
I will keep my promise.

11:51.011 --> 11:53.546
But the truth is Masahiro,

11:53.546 --> 11:59.219
I really wish I didn't have
to grant this request...

11:59.219 --> 12:01.187
I don't want to.

12:05.659 --> 12:10.130
- It's so late, you must be tired.
- Lord Yukinari!

12:10.130 --> 12:13.099
Are you staying
to finish Masahiro's work too?

12:13.099 --> 12:16.202
I'm only doing what I have to do.

12:16.202 --> 12:20.507
I wonder how Masahiro's doing.

12:20.507 --> 12:25.478
I'm sure Masahiro's trying
his best to fulfill his duty.

12:25.478 --> 12:28.538
I'm sure he is.

12:30.016 --> 12:33.787
- Look, it's done.
- You made it as good as new!

12:33.787 --> 12:36.690
- Yeah!
- You know lately...

12:36.690 --> 12:39.926
I've been mending Masahiro's
clothes more than usual.

12:39.926 --> 12:44.864
And every night
he wanders off somewhere...

12:44.864 --> 12:50.770
But since you came here,
you've been such a great help.

12:50.770 --> 12:53.500
Tsuyuki...

12:56.943 --> 13:00.640
I really hope Masahiro's safe.

13:10.056 --> 13:13.626
Where is... this place?

13:13.626 --> 13:18.398
A river bank? Oh, of course...

13:18.398 --> 13:21.201
I have to get to the other side.

13:21.201 --> 13:23.192
What's the matter?

13:23.937 --> 13:27.741
If you don't mind, why don't
you sit here with me.

13:27.741 --> 13:29.732
Sure.

13:34.814 --> 13:37.650
How did you end up here?

13:37.650 --> 13:40.619
It's still too early for you
to cross the river.

13:40.954 --> 13:44.491
There's a wish I'm
desperate to fulfill.

13:44.491 --> 13:47.694
Everything will be over
once I cross the river.

13:47.694 --> 13:51.131
Seems like there's something
holding you back.

13:51.131 --> 13:54.467
I really didn't want
to sadden anyone.

13:54.467 --> 13:59.739
So I wanted to make everyone
think I never existed.

13:59.739 --> 14:04.978
My grandfather has magical
powers so I asked him...

14:04.978 --> 14:08.715
to erase me
from everyone's memories.

14:08.715 --> 14:13.186
I see. So you've come here
before your grandfather.

14:13.186 --> 14:17.423
I came here
before the one I love too,

14:17.423 --> 14:21.018
and thought I shouldn't
cross the river yet.

14:21.094 --> 14:23.897
I'm sure when he catches up
with me...

14:23.897 --> 14:29.028
he'll be upset and ask me
why I left without him.

14:34.941 --> 14:40.079
Just as I thought, you've
come before your time.

14:40.079 --> 14:45.415
See? You have something
important in here.

14:51.758 --> 14:54.194
But I already left it behind...

14:54.194 --> 14:58.298
A heart that will
always pine for you...

14:58.298 --> 15:00.926
Are you going to
let go of everything?

15:05.572 --> 15:11.772
Silly boy, a child
cannot cry silently like that.

15:15.181 --> 15:18.844
How could you let him
shoulder such a heavy burden?

15:21.154 --> 15:24.487
All right, you have to go back.

15:28.862 --> 15:32.365
I'll give you a push.

15:32.365 --> 15:36.495
Go home, Masahiro.

15:37.904 --> 15:40.930
How do you know my name?

15:42.308 --> 15:45.345
Who exactly are you?

15:45.345 --> 15:50.112
Me? My name is Wakana.

15:52.285 --> 15:55.021
Wakana?

15:55.021 --> 15:57.990
Seimei, Masahiro is!

15:59.359 --> 16:01.350
Masahiro!

16:23.283 --> 16:28.220
- Kou?
- Don't make us worry like that.

16:57.050 --> 17:00.353
Suzaku, thank you
for lending us your sword.

17:00.353 --> 17:04.223
I see. So both Touda
and Masahiro are safe?

17:04.223 --> 17:08.125
Yes. How's Tenitsu?

17:09.729 --> 17:13.187
Tenki... Tenotsukijin...

17:14.634 --> 17:17.704
- Sukazu...
- Don't worry.

17:17.704 --> 17:21.196
Tenki will definitely wake up.

17:27.547 --> 17:30.038
Suzaku...

17:33.219 --> 17:36.389
I heard you calling out to me.

17:36.389 --> 17:42.762
- Tenki...
- Only you call me that.

17:42.762 --> 17:48.034
We've moved the princess's
body to the sacred tombs.

17:48.034 --> 17:51.437
- I see.
- Miko told me...

17:51.437 --> 17:54.065
to give this to you.

17:59.812 --> 18:02.015
This is Kazane's...

18:02.015 --> 18:06.281
It's the Miko's wish
that you keep this.

18:17.830 --> 18:21.334
Miss Akiko, what's the matter?

18:21.334 --> 18:27.173
Oh... nothing, I was just
wondering if Masahiro's okay.

18:27.173 --> 18:30.643
Don't worry. He's well.

18:30.643 --> 18:33.646
That's great!

18:33.646 --> 18:37.950
Sorry to bother you.
Good night!

18:37.950 --> 18:40.214
Good night to you.

18:54.700 --> 19:00.400
Masahiro will not be
forgotten by all who know him.

19:02.608 --> 19:04.599
Begone!

19:06.212 --> 19:13.653
The whims of the deities and
evil omens have been surmounted.

19:13.653 --> 19:18.556
Masahiro has returned, but
this comes at a terrible price.

19:26.866 --> 19:29.130
Kou?

19:29.302 --> 19:31.904
Why am I in this form?

19:31.904 --> 19:36.843
- It's an order from Seimei.
- Why am I here?

19:36.843 --> 19:40.506
That's also an order from Seimei.

19:41.681 --> 19:44.707
Then...
who's that over there?

19:46.919 --> 19:54.416
- That's... Seimei's grandson.
- Seimei's grandson?

19:55.761 --> 19:58.531
You know, Wakana,

19:58.531 --> 20:05.905
it'd be great if you took all
the heartache with you too.

20:05.905 --> 20:10.672
Come now, my dear,
that would be selfish.

20:27.760 --> 20:31.831
Whatever I had to lose...

20:31.831 --> 20:36.435
Whatever we have to face
in the future...

20:36.435 --> 20:39.839
No matter what it takes...

20:39.839 --> 20:43.502
Losing you would be
more than I could bear.

20:49.015 --> 20:50.880
Mokkun...

20:59.759 --> 21:06.966
I was always watching
Sou itsumo nagameteita

21:06.966 --> 21:14.574
The scenery beyond these skies
Kono sora no mukou no keshiki

21:14.574 --> 21:22.915
Holding a blank map
Mada hakushi no
chizu wo nigirishime

21:22.915 --> 21:29.488
I'm about to start running
Hashiridashisousa

21:29.488 --> 21:36.896
Rather than floating around in
the sky someone else envisions
Dareka ga egaita yozora ni
tada ukabuyori

21:36.896 --> 21:44.904
I'd chase my own dream
without hesitating
Yume wo oikakete hashiruyo
mou mayowanai

21:44.904 --> 21:52.578
Someday, with these
yet-small hands
Mada chiisana kono ryoute de
itsuka kanarazu

21:52.578 --> 22:01.320
I'll grasp the dreams bigger
than anyone else's
Dareyori mo ookina yume wo
tsukamaeni yukou

22:01.320 --> 22:14.634
A never-ending tale will
transcend time
Owari no nai monogatari wa
Kono toki wo koete

22:14.634 --> 22:21.005
And continue forever
Dokomademo
